From 765b65856276d9f5170c2adcb42b5c5f34d7ced8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@accounts.eddster.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:57:38 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] offline: runtime config from /api/config (banner,
 username, persistence, share note, collaboration)

The offline server serves GET /api/config; the app loads it once before the
first render (defaults on any failure, so older servers keep working):

- environment banner (text/color; BANNER_MODE=sending shows it only while a
  live collaboration session is active), rendered above the editor
- username forced by a reverse-proxy header (optionally locked)
- DISABLE_PERSISTENCE: no scene/share-link storage, share-link export and the
  library publish menu item are hidden
- SHARE_NOTE: plain-text note (with a minimal markup) in the share dialog,
  warning style
- DISABLE_COLLABORATION: no socket is ever opened, #room links keep the local
  scene and show a toast, Share offers only the shareable link

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
